Subject: [PATCH 6/9] arm64: dts: r8a7796: Add USB3.0 host device node
Date: Fri, 18 Aug 2017 10:19:36 +0200
Message-Id: <7b39ccbb4be708c49c7cbd1ce1b91d026c007f1b.1502961153.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
